━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ PointerProbeBox is Box
    is MarkupRootElement

• This
    focus-mode = FocusMode.keys

+ name String
+ trace [String]
+ markup-batch-queue := MarkupBatchQueue(this)

────────────────────
+ This
    - name
    - trace

────────────────────
for event on mouse-down

. point = event.point
trace += "$name:down:$point"

────────────────────
for event on mouse-drag

. point = event.point
trace += "$name:drag:$point"

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌ is MarkupRootElement ╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ do markup-batch-did-flush
